+### Transfer between organizations
+
+- Only org admins of the user's current organization (the `{orgID}` in the path) may transfer its users. Another organization → 404; a member who is not an org admin → 403.
+- The user must exist and belong to `{orgID}`, otherwise 404.
+- `toOrgId` must name an existing organization (one with at least one user or project) and differ from the current one; otherwise 400.
+- A transfer clears the user's org admin flag: admin status does not follow the user.
+- A transfer removes the user's memberships in projects outside the target organization, and unassigns the tasks they hold in those projects, so the rule "project members belong to the project's organization" keeps holding.
